<title>CYPRUS: Cyrpus accepts Lecureur barley tender.</title>
<headline>Cyrpus accepts Lecureur barley tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said on Tuesday it had accepted a tender from Lecureur S.A. Paris for 25,000 tonnes of barley at $148.94 a tonne.</p>
<p>In a statement it said the tender's price was C and F out of Limassol port in Cyprus.</p>
</text>
